## Optional: still images ({{ stills | length }})

These shots are slow zooms over a still picture. Images cost **0 credits** in Flow, so make them: generate the
image in Flow (9:16) and save it as `still_NN.png` (or .jpg/.webp) next to the clips. If no image is in the
inbox, the factory uses the sharpest frame of one of your clips instead.
